SimpleTokenizer.cpp: include <sstream>

std::istringstream and std::ostringstream are used but only <fstream> and
<iostream> are included. Newer libstdc++ (GCC 13+) no longer pulls <sstream>
in transitively, so the types are incomplete:

  error: variable 'std::istringstream iss' has initializer but incomplete type
  error: aggregate 'std::ostringstream result' has incomplete type

Carried here because nvocdr is an upstream submodule this repository cannot
commit to; remove once the fix lands upstream.

--- a/src/SimpleTokenizer.cpp
+++ b/src/SimpleTokenizer.cpp
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #include <fstream>
 #include <iostream>
+#include <sstream>
 #include "SimpleTokenizer.h"
 
